messages.content:
value is [items, size]. Split items into consecutive chunks of at most size, retaining the final short chunk. size is an integer. Raise ValueError when size <= 0.
Implement solve(value), taking one JSON array argument, without mutating that argument. Return only the complete replacement file in exactly one fenced python block.


Current solution.py:
```python
def solve(value):
    items, size = value
    return [items[i:i+size] for i in range(0, len(items)-size+1, size)]
```

